		(property "Notes" "2026-10-30 (was APS0530M3R3H, 3.1 mm tall, hit the cup corner fillet at L502): ABC EHE05023R3MFB (JLC C49248023, in JLC stock), 5.5 x 5.2 x 2.0 mm max, 3.3 uH, 58 mOhm, Isat 5 A (30 %), 4.5 A rated; same electricals and land as COILMX MS0520-3R3M (C18163579, alternate). 2.0 mm height gives ~1.0 mm to the fillet. Isat is below the 5.8 A IHS limit, which is a fault-only peak. Footprint MonolithDev:L_COILMX_MS0520: land H 6.0, G 2.2, F 2.5 = 1.9 x 2.5 at +-2.05"
